                <pb facs="0091" n="19" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg19"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14040/29.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Wilson to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName> (<hi rendition="#italic">Received</hi>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-02-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February 25, 1909</hi></date>).</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reports that the supreme court has granted the unconditional extradition of
                    Damiano, and that agent and prisoner leave on March 10 on steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Verdi.</hi></p>
            </div>
